## Pin model versions

If you deploy to a team, [pin the model IDs](/docs/en/model-config#pin-models-for-third-party-deployments), so a Claude Code update doesn't move everyone to a newer model at once. Add these variables to the `env` block that holds the three variables from [Set up Claude Code](#set-up-claude-code):

```json theme={null}
{
  "env": {
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_OPUS_MODEL": "claude-opus-5-5",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_SONNET_MODEL": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_FABLE_MODEL": "claude-fable-5-1",
    "ANTHROPIC_DEFAULT_HAIKU_MODEL": "claude-haiku-4-5-20251001"
  }
}
```

Use the Claude API model IDs that you want from [Models overview](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/about-claude/models/overview) in place of the example values.
